{"seq":1,"slug":"gradient-ascent","title":"梯度上升遗忘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-unlearning/approximate/gradient-ascent","wordCount":1935,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"梯度上升遗忘\">梯度上升遗忘</h1><p>训练时我们沿损失下降的方向走，让模型在数据上越来越对。遗忘时最朴素的逆操作呼之欲出：在遗忘集上沿损失<strong>上升</strong>的方向走，让模型在这些数据上越来越错。这就是梯度上升遗忘（gradient ascent unlearning），近似遗忘里最直接、也最先被想到的一族。它的全部魅力在于直觉的清晰，全部麻烦在于把这个直觉真正驯服。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇是近似遗忘的入口，先把这一族的共同词汇定清楚。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>梯度上升遗忘（gradient ascent unlearning, GA）</strong>：在遗忘集上沿损失<strong>上升</strong>方向更新，让模型在这些数据上越来越错——即「反向训练」。</li>\n<li><strong>灾难性遗忘（catastrophic forgetting）</strong>：因交叉熵损失无上界，最大化它会把 logit 推向负无穷，导致优化发散、连带拖垮保留集能力。这是朴素 GA 的致命病根。</li>\n<li><strong>遗忘项 + 保留项</strong>：实用的 GA 必须加上保留集上的正常训练损失，把目标写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\mathcal{L}(\\theta; D_f) + \\lambda \\mathcal{L}(\\theta; D_r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这个结构是几乎所有近似方法的共同骨架。</li>\n<li><strong>NPO（负偏好优化）</strong>：借 DPO 的有界损失把遗忘集当成纯负偏好，样本概率趋零时梯度自动衰减，给遗忘装上「自动刹车」。</li>\n<li><strong>RMU（表示误导）</strong>：不在输出层而在隐藏表示层动手，把危险概念的激活带偏成随机方向噪声，擅长概念级清除。</li>\n<li><strong>表面遗忘</strong>：只在可观测行为上像遗忘了，信息仍蛰伏在权重里，换问法或重学习即可恢复。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有了这套词汇，就能看清这三种方法在「省什么、赌什么」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"朴素梯度上升与它的发散问题\">朴素梯度上升与它的发散问题</h2><p>设遗忘集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，模型参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，标准训练损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>。朴素梯度上升把更新写成在遗忘集上的梯度反号：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>η</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta \\leftarrow \\theta + \\eta \\nabla_\\theta \\mathcal{L}(\\theta; D_f)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一步在做的事，是主动增大模型在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上的损失。问题立刻浮现：交叉熵损失没有上界，最大化它意味着把概率推向零、把 logit 推向负无穷。优化没有自然的停止点，模型会一路发散——不仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上崩坏，连带 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上的能力一起拖垮。这就是「灾难性遗忘」在遗忘语境下的体现：你想删一行，结果删塌了半个模型。</p>\n<p>实践中必须给朴素梯度上升加约束才能用。最常见的是加一项保留集上的正常训练损失，把目标写成两股力的拉锯：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>unlearn</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{unlearn}} = -\\mathcal{L}(\\theta; D_f) + \\lambda \\mathcal{L}(\\theta; D_r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unlearn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>前一项推动遗忘，后一项把模型按在保留集上不许乱跑，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是两者的配平旋钮。这个「遗忘项 + 保留项」的结构，是后面几乎所有近似方法的共同骨架——它把 <a href=\"../practice/unlearning-evaluation\">遗忘评测</a> 里那对永恒矛盾「遗忘质量 vs 模型效用」直接写进了损失函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"npo-把上界还给损失\">NPO：把上界还给损失</h2><p>朴素梯度上升发散的病根，是损失无上界。2024 年提出的 NPO（Negative Preference Optimization，负偏好优化）从一个意外的方向治这个病：它借用偏好对齐里 DPO 的损失形式。DPO 本是用「好回答优于坏回答」的成对偏好来塑造模型，NPO 把它截断成「只有坏样本」——把遗忘集样本当成纯粹的负偏好，用一个有界的、形如 sigmoid 的损失去压制它们的生成概率。</p>\n<p>关键差别在于损失的形状。朴素梯度上升的梯度在样本被压得越低时反而越大（越压越猛，直到发散），而 NPO 的有界损失在样本概率趋近零时梯度自动衰减——遗忘到位了就自然刹车。这个「自动刹车」特性让 NPO 的训练稳定性远胜朴素梯度上升，也是它成为 2024–2026 年遗忘基线主力的原因。NPO 与对齐方法的同源关系，详见 <a href=\"../../rlhf-preference-alignment/direct-methods/dpo\">DPO 直接偏好优化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rmu-不在输出层而在表示层动手\">RMU：不在输出层而在表示层动手</h2><p>梯度上升和 NPO 都在输出概率上做文章，RMU（Representation Misdirection for Unlearning，表示误导）换了个层面：它直接操纵模型的中间隐藏表示。对遗忘集的输入，RMU 把某一层的隐藏激活强行「带偏」到一个随机方向；对保留集的输入，则约束激活尽量不变。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>RMU</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>u</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>遗忘:激活推向随机向量</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>α</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mtext>orig</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>保留:激活保持原样</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{RMU}} = \\underbrace{\\mathbb{E}_{x\\in D_f}\\|h_\\ell(x) - c\\cdot u\\|^2}_{\\text{遗忘:激活推向随机向量}} + \\underbrace{\\alpha\\,\\mathbb{E}_{x\\in D_r}\\|h_\\ell(x) - h_\\ell^{\\text{orig}}(x)\\|^2}_{\\text{保留:激活保持原样}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">RMU</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5435em;vertical-align:-1.6794em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.3206em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">遗忘</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">激活推向随机向量</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-1.9989em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAs